    "detailed_description": "GRAAMASEVA is the first top-down view, horizontal scrolling run n' gun arcade game.<br><br>It has the following features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Top-down horizontal run n' gun, 1 or 2 player co-op arcade action </li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256860/extras/d5b378e21bbc7cdbc89a7fec64c17f78.poster.avif?t=1727452718\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256860/extras/d5b378e21bbc7cdbc89a7fec64c17f78.webm?t=1727452718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256860/extras/d5b378e21bbc7cdbc89a7fec64c17f78.mp4?t=1727452718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play offensively and use weapons or play stealthy and fast to go for the high score </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Enemy movement and AI based on the original ancient Indian version of chess </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pick Up and Play Controls: </li></ul></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256860/extras/30303227c31571f15bdab8bdaefea82d.avif?t=1727452718\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 15 playable characters to choose from with different attributes and abilities </li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256860/extras/Graamaseva_GIF_001.gif?t=1717684759?t=1727452718\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Randomized or controllable slot machine that controls level obstacle parameters </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 15 long (4+ minutes) levels and secret passages offer a lot of replay value </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Choose from 6 routes based on the 6 seasons of India to make it to the final boss </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A surprise ending can be achieved based on player's actions at the game's end </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Many more options and ways to play depending on your preference and play style </li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256860/extras/65b95ad91b1447d4ef4d0e37fd597dff.poster.avif?t=1727452718\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256860/extras/65b95ad91b1447d4ef4d0e37fd597dff.webm?t=1727452718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
